  "body": "## What's Changed\n* Follow the fetch_update rename so clippy on current stable passes by @BABTUNA in https://github.com/smol-machines/smolvm/pull/1505\n* Let the API amend a stopped machine's egress allow list by @BABTUNA in https://github.com/smol-machines/smolvm/pull/1501\n* Allow clippy::double_must_use on the shim's async trait by @LoganGrasby in https://github.com/smol-machines/smolvm/pull/1508\n* Reject unknown fields on the mutating API request types by @BABTUNA in https://github.com/smol-machines/smolvm/pull/1509\n* Bump the workspace to 1.22.2 by @BinSquare in https://github.com/smol-machines/smolvm/pull/1513\n\n\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/smol-machines/smolvm/compare/v1.22.1...v1.22.2",
